  <diagram id="pg_onhold" name="99 On hold (excluded for now)">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="2339" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="onhold_banner" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px;color:#b85450&quot;&gt;ON HOLD — excluded from the current build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#555&quot;&gt;The first release is a light core product; schools are not expected to use chat, internal mail, call logs, to-dos or notes yet.&lt;br&gt;The public website and in-app support desk are not needed for the light first release.&lt;br&gt;Workflow automation and the shared inbox are advanced features that customers will not use in the light first release. Basic announcements, notices, SMS / WhatsApp / email sending and logs stay in the main schema.&lt;br&gt;AI and analytics are postponed until the main modules (academics, people, attendance, exams, fees, library, transport, hostel, communication) are built.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Held modules:&lt;/b&gt; Productivity Apps (9 tables), Website &amp;amp; Support (11 tables), Automation &amp;amp; Advanced Messaging (6 tables), Reports, Analytics &amp;amp; AI (3 tables). &lt;b&gt;Safe to ignore for now:&lt;/b&gt; no main table has a foreign key into anything on this page (checked on every build), and their DDL is in a separate file, &lt;code&gt;schema-on-hold.sql&lt;/code&gt;, which you run only when you start work on them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Frontend features on hold, and the data they will use once released&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;color:#888&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding-right:14px&quot;&gt;Feature&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding-right:14px&quot;&gt;Feature list / API id&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Backing data&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Email, To Do, Notes pages (1.2.4, 1.2.5, 1.2.6) and chat&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;A:1.2.4-1.2.6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;mail_messages, mail_recipients, mail_attachments, user_todos, user_notes, chat_conversations, chat_participants, chat_messages, call_logs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;CMS &amp;amp; Pages: Pages, Blog, Testimonials, FAQ, Contact Messages, Tickets (11.1-11.6)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;A:11.1-11.6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;cms_pages, blogs, blog_categories, blog_tags, blog_post_tags, blog_comments, testimonials, faqs, contact_messages, tickets, ticket_messages&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Workflow Rules and Trigger Actions (7.5.1, 7.5.2)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;A:7.5.1-7.5.2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;workflow_rules, workflow_runs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Scheduled Tasks (7.5.3)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;A:7.5.3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;scheduled_tasks, scheduled_task_runs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;WhatsApp Chat Inbox (7.3.4): assignment, snooze, resolve&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;A:7.3.4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;communication_threads, thread_messages&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;AI Teacher Productivity page; AI services (POST /ai/:service/run)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;X:mainMenu/ai-teacher-productivity, B:ctl/ai, B:ai-jobs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;ai_jobs (reads lesson_plans, homework, marks as inputs)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Custom Reports (8.1.8) and saved reports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;B:saved-reports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;saved_reports, report_runs&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Attendance, Academic, Grade and Fee Collection reports (8.1.1, 8.1.2, 8.1.5, 8.1.6)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;B:ctl/reports&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;No new tables: v_student_attendance_summary, exam_results, v_invoice_balances, payments&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Student Performance, Class Analytics, Teacher Performance (8.1.3, 8.1.4, 8.1.7); Performance Analytics (3.5.10)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;frontend analytics pages&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;No new tables: marks, exam_results, student_attendance, homework_submissions, section_subject_teachers&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;Dashboard &amp;quot;Analytics&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Insights&amp;quot; widgets (12.2.5, 12.2.6)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 14px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;color:#666;font-family:monospace;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;frontend widgets&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:3px 0;vertical-align:top&quot;&gt;No new tables: cached aggregate queries (Chapter 20 of the backend guide)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#888&quot;&gt;To hold or release another module, edit &lt;code&gt;tools/spec/00-modules.mjs&lt;/code&gt; (the &lt;code&gt;onHold&lt;/code&gt; option) and run &lt;code&gt;npm run build&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fillColor=#fff4f2;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
